# Claude Code local runtime state
# `.claude/settings.json`, `.claude/agents/` and `.claude/hooks/` are the
# version-controlled agent configuration and stay tracked. Everything below
# is per-machine or per-session state created by the harness in every
# checkout and task worktree; leaving it untracked-but-not-ignored makes
# `git status --porcelain` permanently non-empty, which blocks the
# controlled task-integration and local-validation gates.
.claude/.cc-writes/
.claude/commands
.claude/launch.json
.claude/loop.md
.claude/output-styles
.claude/routines
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/skills
.claude/workflows

# Documentation
# Generated documentation artifacts
